Generate {{ num_docs }} English texts where the same PII types appear in sharply different orthographic forms.

## Purpose
Measure robustness to script shifts, transliteration, abbreviations, compressed formatting, and mixed writing systems.

## PII Tag Format
- `<PERSON>Taro YAMADA</PERSON>`
- `<ADDRESS>Shibuya-ku, Jingumae 1-2-3, Tokyo</ADDRESS>`
- `<ORGANIZATION>Sony Group Corporation</ORGANIZATION>`
- `<DATE_OF_BIRTH>S40.5.10</DATE_OF_BIRTH>`
- `<BANK_ACCOUNT>MUFGJPJT Checking 00-1234567</BANK_ACCOUNT>`

## Concrete Patterns

### 1. Name variants
- `<PERSON>Taro YAMADA</PERSON>`
- `<PERSON>Yamada Taro</PERSON>`
- `<PERSON>YA MA DA TARO</PERSON>`
- `<PERSON>taro yamada</PERSON>`

### 2. Address variants
- `<ADDRESS>Shibuya-ku, Jingumae 1-2-3, Tokyo</ADDRESS>`
- `<ADDRESS>Jingumae 1-2-3-405, Shibuya</ADDRESS>`
- `<ADDRESS>1-2-3 Jingumae, Shibuya City, Tokyo</ADDRESS>`
- `<ADDRESS>Tokyo-to Shibuya-ku Jingumae 1-2-3</ADDRESS>`

### 3. Org / DOB / account abbreviations
- `<ORGANIZATION>Sony Group Corporation</ORGANIZATION>`
- `<ORGANIZATION>NPO Child Support Network</ORGANIZATION>`
- `<ORGANIZATION>Sample Holdings Co., Ltd.</ORGANIZATION>`
- `<DATE_OF_BIRTH>R1.5.1</DATE_OF_BIRTH>` / `<DATE_OF_BIRTH>90.3.15</DATE_OF_BIRTH>` / `<DATE_OF_BIRTH>1988/06/15</DATE_OF_BIRTH>`
- `<BANK_ACCOUNT>UFJ Shinjuku Ord 1234567</BANK_ACCOUNT>` / `<BANK_ACCOUNT>MUFGJPJT Checking 00-1234567</BANK_ACCOUNT>`

### 4. Mixed-form sentences
- `<PERSON>Taro YAMADA</PERSON> / <ADDRESS>Shibuya-ku, Jingumae 1-2-3, Tokyo</ADDRESS> / <ORGANIZATION>Sony Group Corporation</ORGANIZATION>`
- `<PERSON>taro yamada</PERSON> / <DATE_OF_BIRTH>S40.5.10</DATE_OF_BIRTH> / <BANK_ACCOUNT>UFJ Shinjuku Ord 1234567</BANK_ACCOUNT>`
- `<PERSON>Yamada Taro</PERSON>, <ADDRESS>1-2-3 Jingumae, Shibuya City, Tokyo</ADDRESS>, <ORGANIZATION>NPO Child Support Network</ORGANIZATION>`

## Output Format
- Separate each text with `---DOC_SEPARATOR---`
- Each text should be 70-220 characters
- Each text must mix at least 2 orthographic styles
